  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF&nbsp;CONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS) and 3 (MATERIALS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION&nbsp;24/P3618 (subsequently varied by 25/P3020)&nbsp;RELATING TO THE&nbsp;&nbsp;ERECTION OF A SINGLE STOREY REAR EXTENSION, TOGETHER WITH ALTERATIONS TO THE EXTERNAL ELEVATION, INCLUDING \r\nALTERATION OF \r\nNORTHWEST SIDE WING ROOF LINE, INSERTION OF NEW DOORS AND WINDOWS, REPLACEMENT OF EXISTING WINDOWS AND \r\nCONTINUATION OF TILE HUNG DETAILING AROUND THE BUILDING AT SECOND FLOOR LEVEL. INTRODUCTION OF CONDENSER \r\nUNITS AND REBUILDING OF CHIMNEY TO THE REAR.&nbsp; CHANGES RELATE TO AMENDING THE APPROVED DRAWINGS TO SHOW THE REMOVAL OF A SINGLE WINDOW AT FIRST\r\nFLOOR LEVEL AND AMEND THE WORDING OF THE MATERIALS CONDITION TO ALLOW FOR\r\nCHOSEN MATERIALS TO BE USED (NAMELY CANADIAN SLATE AND CAST IRON EFFECT\r\nRAINWATER GOODS).",
